1210
01:21:25,610 --> 01:21:27,529
Jangan hiraukan dia, Lois.

1211
01:21:28,238 --> 01:21:30,364
Dia orang yang sentimental.

1212
01:21:30,365 --> 01:21:33,076
Terutama soal Clark.

1213
01:21:44,587 --> 01:21:46,172
Hubungi aku!

1214
