Aku tidak pindahkan.

1595
01:57:12,298 --> 01:57:13,633
Di mana anjingku?

1596
01:57:21,182 --> 01:57:23,600
Ini sebabnya anjing itu
punya masalah perilaku.

1597
01:57:23,601 --> 01:57:25,019
Tidak ada batasan.

1598
01:57:28,439 --> 01:57:29,858
Itu tidak sehat, bukan?

1599
01:57:39,868 --> 01:57:41,034
Ayo.

1600
01:57:41,035 --> 01:57:43,246
Terima kasih sudah menjaganya.

1601
01:57:46,624 --> 01:57:49,126
Dia suka pergi berpesta di planet lain.

1602
01:57:49,127 --> 01:57:50,879
Planet dengan matahari merah.

1603
01:57:51,337 --> 01:57:52,629
Karena metabolisme kami,

1604
01:57:52,630 --> 01:57:55,215
kami tidak bisa mabuk
di planet dengan matahari kuning.

1605
01:57:55,216 --> 01:57:57,676
Andai aku punya kapasitas emosional,

1606
01:57:57,677 --> 01:57:59,721
aku akan khawatir dia berpesta.

1607
01:58:00,013 --> 01:58:00,763
Ya.

1608
01:58:01,097 --> 01:58:04,474
Superman, mau lihat rekaman orang tuamu?

1609
01:58:04,475 --> 01:58:06,352
Itu membuatnya tenang.

1610
01:58:07,437 --> 01:58:09,314
Ya, Gary, ide bagus.

1611
01:58:16,321 --> 01:58:18,656
<i>Semua yang kau lihat,
kau melihatnya untuk pertama kali.</i>

1612
01:58:26,039 --> 01:58:27,874
<i>Semua ini untukmu.</i>

1613
01:58:30,877 --> 01:58:31,794
<i>Clark.</i>

1614
01:58:42,180 --> 01:58:43,181
<i>Kau berhasil!</i>

1615
02:08:33,188 --> 02:08:34,105
Ada apa?

1616
02:08:37,984 --> 02:08:38,735
Ya?

1617
02:08:39,152 --> 02:08:41,153
Hanya... agak miring.

1618
02:08:41,154 --> 02:08:42,487
Aku harus apa?

1619
02:08:42,488 --> 02:08:44,448
Mau kubongkar dan bangun kembali?

1620
02:08:44,449 --> 02:08:45,992
Tidak. Aku hanya...

1621
02:08:47,911 --> 02:08:48,953
Kau hanya apa?

1622
02:08:51,414 --> 02:08:54,000
Maaf, Kawan.
Aku tak bermaksud membuatmu kesal.

1623
02:08:55,210 --> 02:08:56,836
Seharusnya tak perlu kubahas.

1624
02:08:57,795 --> 02:09:00,465
Terkadang aku memang menyebalkan.

